        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Hongshan culture</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Homeland</span><span class="info-stat-val">The West Liao river basin in northeast <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/china">China</a>, from <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/inner-mongolia">Inner Mongolia</a> to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/liaoning">Liaoning</a>; the type site of Hongshanhou in Hongshan District, Chifeng; the ritual complex of Niuheliang; Haminmangha.</span></div>
