          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">How we know them</span><span class="info-stat-val">The Hongshanhou site, discovered by Torii Ryūzō in 1908 and excavated extensively in 1935 by Kōsaku Hamada and Mizuno Seiichi; excavations at Niuheliang; isotope analyses of diet; ancient DNA studies of 2013, 2020, 2021 and 2025; a 2015 study of the region’s past environment.</span></div>
